        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Another idea that would help my specific issue:\r\nMake the next and previous entry action a configurable mapping. I would remap those to <C-J> and <C-K> and just have my arrow keys go to next line in insert mode. \r\nI know moving with arrow keys in Insert mode is somewhat frowned upon, but when changing single digit numbers in 10 lines in succession, exiting insert mode, using \"j\" and going into insert mode, is just a lot of keypresses.",
