        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ok, that's good to know. I'll look into modifiying this in my keymap then.\r\n\r\nEdit: A quick thing that works for me:\r\n```\r\nvim.api.nvim_set_keymap('i', '<Down>',   [[pumvisible() ? \"<C-o>j\" : \"\\<Down>\"]],   { expr = true, noremap = true })\r\nvim.api.nvim_set_keymap('i', '<Up>', [[pumvisible() ? \"<C-o>k\" : \"\\<Up>\"]], { expr = true , noremap = true})\r\n```\r\nSo my personal issue is resolved. If it's not feasible to include the initial options proposed, i'm fine with closing this issue.",
